WEBVTT - Editor experience: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:06.964
Editors want to click into the page and type,
not fill in forms.

2
00:00:08.064 --> 00:00:13.510
Editor experience: four skills for TYPO3 v14.

3
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:22.398
Prepares templates so editors click into the
page and type, with every output traceable to
its record.

4
00:00:23.748 --> 00:00:30.761
In the Visual Editor: click the headline, type,
save. The record is updated.

5
00:00:31.861 --> 00:00:38.430
Prepares content in a workspace, then reviews
and publishes it, with the file traps named.

6
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:47.864
A preview that shows the live page, or images
that lose their references on publishing, are
the usual surprises.

7
00:00:49.264 --> 00:00:57.218
Shows records as grid, teaser, timeline or board
views in the Records module, set in TSconfig.

8
00:00:58.568 --> 00:01:05.216
Grid, timeline, catalogue: editors switch views,
and nothing in core is patched.

9
00:01:06.418 --> 00:01:12.987
Configures RTE presets and builds CKEditor 5
plugins for TYPO3.

10
00:01:14.337 --> 00:01:23.127
CKEditor 5 is a complete rewrite with no
compatibility layer for version 4, so old
plugins need a plan.

11
00:01:24.727 --> 00:01:28.867
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
